<%#
  Offered once to somebody reading the Bangla site: the same page in English.

  WHICH WAY ROUND, AND WHY IT CHANGED. This used to do the opposite -- everyone
  landed on English and a visitor in Bangladesh was asked whether they would
  rather read Bangla. The owner's judgement, and it is the right one: a
  Bangladeshi customer who has arrived on an English page has already had to
  work out that this shop is for them. So the site now SERVES Bangla to a
  Bangladeshi visitor (i18n.redirectByCountry) and this is the way back.

  IT ASKS ONCE. Choosing either language, or dismissing it, writes
  `vh_lang_asked` and it never returns -- a bar that comes back on every page
  is an argument rather than an offer. Choosing English goes through the
  ordinary switcher (/lang/en), so it is remembered exactly as a click in the
  footer would be, and i18n.redirectByCountry then leaves them alone for good.

  It is rendered only where it applies, so no other page carries the markup,
  and it needs no JavaScript to be correct -- the English choice is a link.
%>
<% if (locale === 'bn') { %>
  <div class="lang-offer" id="lang-offer" hidden data-once="vh_lang_asked">
    <div class="lang-offer-inner">
      <p class="lang-offer-text">
        <span class="lang-offer-bn" lang="bn">ইংরেজিতে পড়তে চান?</span>
        <span class="lang-offer-en">Prefer to read this in English?</span>
      </p>
      <div class="lang-offer-actions">
        <%# data-no-router, exactly as the footer's switcher has: a language
            change must be a real navigation. Without it the no-reload router
            swapped the page's contents and left <html lang> saying bn, so the
            English page announced itself as Bangla to a screen reader and to
            every crawler. Measured on live before this attribute was added. %>
        <a class="btn btn-sm" href="<%= langHref('en') %>" rel="nofollow" data-no-router
           data-lang-offer="en" lang="en">Read in English</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-lang-offer="bn" lang="bn">বাংলাতেই থাক</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<% } %>
